e6iOcaZ5rLDG3lZBP3j7a.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kYlBNDkB5qFdpTDpnlQdH0CdK3T.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of Oakland Athletics general manager Billy Beane's successful attempt to put together a baseball team on a budget, by employing computer-generated analysis to draft his players.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":109410,\"title\":\"42\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iZ7jVGQWj3eBUdqwAPUlKk0BaS2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eyjWwMOgkq4nh0wMtyW8XPJ749H.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1947, Jackie Robinson becomes the first Black man to play in Major League Baseball facing unabashed racism from the public, the press and other players.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":87825,\"title\":\"Trouble with the Curve\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zLZQVmxOj5kICbS5Pq7rB1cbPvP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ivndXrpSYpCSuu2S5OrUvzAetCc.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Slowed by age and failing eyesight, crack baseball scout Gus Lobel takes his grown daughter along as he checks out the final prospect of his career. Along the way, the two renew their bond, and she catches the eye of a young player-turned-scout.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14635,\"title\":\"The Rookie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gNmLsseIs6thkBKne91iQZDGyBT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gf5ahmfnGuM02RJyoETKQXTLft0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jim Morris never made it out of the minor leagues before a shoulder injury ended his pitching career twelve years ago. Now a married-with-children high-school chemistry teacher and baseball coach in Texas, Jim's team makes a deal with him: if they win the district championship, Jim will try out with a major-league organization. The bet proves incentive enough for the team, and they go from worst to first, making it to state for the first time in the history of the school. Jim, forced to live up to his end of the deal, is nearly laughed off the try-out field--until he gets onto the mound, where he confounds the scouts (and himself) by clocking successive 98 mph fastballs, good enough for a minor-league contract with the Tampa Bay Devil Rays. Jim's still got a lot of pitches to throw before he makes it to The Show, but with his big-league dreams revived, there's no telling where he could go.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":243352,\"title\":\"Where Hope Grows\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gQmOsU2hA0PrGvxGjzty1S2OO3H.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fLJUO27NcQymwcBkNX4Na8NNk64.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Calvin Campbell is a former professional baseball player sent to an early retirement due to his panic attacks at the plate. Even though he had all the talent for the big leagues, he struggles with the curveballs life has thrown him. Today, he mindlessly sleepwalks through his days and the challenge of raising his teenager daughter. His life is in a slow downward spiral when it is suddenly awakened and invigorated by the most unlikely person – Produce, a young-man with Down syndrome who works at the local grocery store.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":862557,\"title\":\"The Hill\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e8Dx470lSbIL7OFj7TkFsWAONR5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/puUUsAri2UchyJgsbkpO3HZfKiw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of Rickey Hill, who overcomes his physical disability and repairs his relationship with his father in a quest to become a major league baseball (MLB) player.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":198185,\"title\":\"Million Dollar Arm\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6OgA9x6jvwBIj8e7x8LANTbVvR2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7I5uDeJfST5EgU3yQHpO3ExyBQk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a last-ditch effort to save his career, sports agent JB Bernstein dreams up a wild game plan to find Major League Baseball’s next great pitcher from a pool of cricket players in India. He soon discovers two young men who can throw a fastball but know nothing about the game of baseball. Or America. It’s an incredible and touching journey that will change them all — especially JB, who learns valuable lessons about teamwork, commitment and family.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":467952,\"title\":\"The Catcher Was a Spy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3aBv9Oln0aoBrEbkMabHIVat6CY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pHFNaNHqiaZ2myMAsylIm2y17c7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Former major league baseball player Moe Berg lives a double life working for the Office of Strategic Services in World War II Europe.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":56601,\"title\":\"The Perfect Game\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kwn02B0AyQYXzftAo9StX8JD2JY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7bfV7f4G6s1oVj06m6ztXPK4YzP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on a true story, a group of boys from Monterrey, Mexico who become the first non-U.S. team to win the Little League World Series.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22597,\"title\":\"The Broken Hearts Club: A Romantic Comedy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g9bqbopRZYy5Z2137zFoFQRXVEW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bu8Ixqtg7vx1L0UlnV5sekYXizU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A close-knit group of gay friends share the emotional roller coster of life, relationships, the death of friends, new beginnings, jealousy, fatherhood and professional success. At various stages of life's disarray, these young men share humorous and tragic relationships and always have each other to rely on.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16232,\"title\":\"Mr. 3000\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g7CNkytZsZzQ8ZEr8F4SmrhjI5y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9wTvyVN6l0i5F5qOhs8iuSVF3Oc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Aging baseball star who goes by the nickname, Mr. 3000, finds out many years after retirement that he didn't quite reach 3,000 hits. Now at age 47 he's back to try and reach that goal.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1626881,\"title\":\"Stolen Moments\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/85xpR4uG6pUypBZBBgvATejglLS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"College student and his friends recreate the 1914 World Series to help and aging Alzheimers patient hold on to a special memory.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"YjuJyg41h2A\",\"name\":\"Duel at the Mound - Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}